1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,340
Hi,

2
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,180
I'm Tzuyu Chang.

3
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:01,775
In this project,

4
00:00:01,775 --> 00:00:04,335
I work as a full stack developer,

5
00:00:04,335 --> 00:00:08,350
primarily focusing on front end optimization and presentation.

6
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,334
On the front end,

7
00:00:09,334 --> 00:00:12,494
I bootstrapped our react application using typescript,

8
00:00:12,494 --> 00:00:13,854
vite and tailwind.

9
00:00:13,854 --> 00:00:18,350
I integrated the google maps APIs to build our core interactive map.

10
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:22,065
Featuring real-time station markers and availability badges,

11
00:00:22,065 --> 00:00:27,620
I also developed the detailed station panels for historical and predictive data.

12
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:33,610
Along with the complete user authentication and profile interfaces to ensure smooth data flow.

13
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:40,800
I wrote the front end logic to unwrap API responses and format them perfectly for our rechart.

14
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:41,628
On the backend,

15
00:00:41,628 --> 00:00:46,850
I decide the real time station status end point using an efficient sql alchemy.

16
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:50,835
Subquery with func.max to avoid expensive full table scans.

17
00:00:50,835 --> 00:00:54,770
I was responsible for authoring the overview requirements.

18
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:57,267
And testing section for our final project report.

19
00:00:57,267 --> 00:00:59,867
I'm also the scrum master for the sprint 1 and sprint 4.

20
00:00:59,867 --> 00:01:00,715
Thank you!
